    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay, but honestly though, when you look at the actual risks of climate change vs the cost of electricity, doesnt it feel like the economic stuff is kind of a distraction? like, if the planet is dying, does it really matter if energy prices go up for a few years?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
